                                "example_id": "c48ac0ac-429b-499b-80e2-1eb34d47a18a",
                                "sense_id": "2e36ed6a-faa1-3361-846d-dd59574baaf3",
                                "text": "This, too, has now been restored and reupholstered, and the unusual pair of méridiennes (short daybeds) will be installed on either side of the mantlepiece in the upstairs hall."
